{"track":"r","category":"함수·재귀","level":3,"title":"거듭제곱 (재귀)","desc":"<p><code>base</code>의 <code>exp</code>제곱(<code>exp ≥ 0</code>)을 <b>재귀</b>로 구하는 <code>power_rec(base, exp)</code>를 만드세요. (<code>^</code> 연산자 없이)</p>","solution":"power_rec <- function(base, exp) {\n  if (exp == 0) {\n    return(1)\n  }\n  base * power_rec(base, exp - 1)\n}\n","hint":"<p>base^0 = 1, base^exp = base × base^(exp−1).</p>","tests":[{"call":"power_rec(2, 10)","expected":1024,"visible":true},{"call":"power_rec(5, 0)","expected":1,"visible":true},{"call":"power_rec(3, 3)","expected":27,"visible":false},{"call":"power_rec(2, 0)","expected":1,"visible":false}],"starter":"power_rec <- function(base, exp) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-349"}